# Type-flaw resistant NSPK with Lowe's fix

functions:
public tag1: bitstring
public tag2: bitstring
public tag3: bitstring

cells:

agents: A B

knowledge: 
A knows A B pk(A) pk(B) inv(pk(A)).
B knows A B pk(A) pk(B) inv(pk(B)).

events: 

queries:

choreo:

A: new NA.
A -> B: crypt((tag1,NA,A),pk(B)).
B: new NB.
B -> A: crypt((tag2,NA,NB,B),pk(A)).
A -> B: crypt((tag3,NB),pk(B)).
NA secret between A B. # true
NB secret between A B. # true
B authenticates A on NA. # true
A authenticates B on NB. # true
end